WEBVTT

00:04:29.436 --> 00:04:33.876
But if you want to keep
the carbon locked up in the wood,

00:04:33.876 --> 00:04:36.636
there are technological ways
to do that as well,

00:04:36.636 --> 00:04:37.636
like this one.

00:04:37.636 --> 00:04:38.636
Look at this.

00:04:38.956 --> 00:04:41.836
A whole new movement
to use wood as a building material

00:04:41.836 --> 00:04:44.076
in modern, high-rise buildings.

00:04:44.276 --> 00:04:46.436
That’s a good idea
for at least three reasons.

00:04:46.436 --> 00:04:49.156
First of all, it keeps
the carbon locked up in the wood.

00:04:49.156 --> 00:04:52.756
Secondly, it displaces
high-emitting materials like concrete.

00:04:52.756 --> 00:04:55.516
And thirdly, the buildings are gorgeous.

00:04:58.516 --> 00:05:01.956
Now you can also use technology
to help carbon stay locked up in soil.